Use IO's Print from `io` as "Print".
"Left" is a New Adjective describing any Service, Object, or Function.
It describes a Generic `left` Function of any Process with No Inputs and No Outputs.
It describes a Generic `left` Object with a New Objective Left Function using any Process.
It describes a Generic `left` Service with a New Left Object using any Process.
"Right" is a New Adjective describing any Service, Object, or Function.
It describes a Generic `right` Function of any Process with No Inputs and No Outputs.
It describes a Generic `right` Object with a New Objective Right Function using any Process.
It describes a Generic `right` Service with a New Right Object using any Process.
"Grouped" describes a Generic App with a New Main Service, New Left Service, and New Right Service using any Process.
Create "First" as a New Grouped App.
The App Prints `first-service-body`.

Create "Second" as a New Grouped App.
The App Prints `second-service-body`.
